# 🔍 Digital Forensics & Steganography

## 📌 Overview
This project demonstrates how hidden data can be embedded and extracted from image files using steganography techniques.

---

## 🎯 Objectives
- Detect hidden data in images
- Extract concealed information
- Analyze metadata

---

## 🛠️ Tools Used
- Steghide
- Binwalk
- ExifTool

---

## 🔎 Steps Performed

1. Checked metadata using:
   exiftool image.jpg

2. Scanned file using:
   binwalk image.jpg

3. Extracted hidden data:
   steghide extract -sf image.jpg

---

## 📊 Outcome
- Successfully extracted hidden data
- Analyzed metadata for forensic insights

